Starwhale in the Skysea

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:00.590
Really, though,

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:04.100
Adele-sama's story was incredible!

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.350
It was quite an epic.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:12.230
She changed the entire world when she was just our age.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.230
She even risked her life for it, too.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.400
We have much to learn from them.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:22.370
We must work toward the betterment of not just our nation, but the whole continent.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:23.660
Yeah!

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.580
Leo-nee!

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:25.700
Nanami!

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:27.580
Good morning!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.660
Morning!

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.250
Good morning!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.500
Huh, where are Shinku and Lief?

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.250
They're practicing their swordsmanship.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.260
Lord Gaul was with them too.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:42.640
They said they didn't want to be in the way of a girls' day out.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.140
I see.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.520
What was that?

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:50.890
I'm not sure...

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:06.910
Priestess-sama!

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.540
And the Flame Dragon!

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:09.790
Wow!

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:13.170
Lords and heroes of the tripartite alliance!

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.670
I'm sorry to bother you without prior notice.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:19.260
May we talk for a moment?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.470
The Skysea was too calm last night.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.100
The Skysea?

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.100
Ahem.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.180
Allow me to explain.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:31.850
Rebecca and I are experts!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:33.980
We just learned about this, right?

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:39.070
There's a sea called the "Skysea" above the skies of Flonyard.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:41.570
Not that it's actually filled with water.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:44.320
It's made up of the space between the clouds and floating islands

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.030
and the animals and spirits that live there.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:53.160
They never come down, so they have their own ecosystem up there!

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:54.120
Cool...

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.500
There are no nations or territories in the Skysea,

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.000
but some of its residents hold the power of peace.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.010
And that's the Starwhale!

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:05.760
It's a gigantic flying spirit, even bigger than a whole mountain range!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:10.310
According to what we know today, it is classified as a spirit,

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:13.270
but some say it is a servant of the ancient gods

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.270
or a relative of the dragons we know.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:22.440
It's existed on Flonyard long before not only us humans,

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.030
but even before the Divinegons.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:28.280
There are even times of the year where you can see it swimming through the sky.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:32.950
And, just like we have a dragon priestess to connect us with the dragons,

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:38.670
we have a sky priestess between us and the Starwhale.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:43.800
When things happen up in the sky, she comes down to tell us.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.170
I see.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:50.260
Although, since the sky priestess has only been seen in old fairy tales,

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.430
nobody knows if she actually exists.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.940
It certainly is a nice story.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:05:03.820
It might have come from the fact that we can predict the weather by watching the sky.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.070
That's right.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.780
Uh...

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.570
I've met the sky priestess...

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.660
And not just once.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:18.330
Pega is a celestial messenger born at the sky priestess's abode.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.420
What?!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.590
Really?!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.210
Pega said that something may be amiss in the Skysea.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.800
It could be the Skysea itself.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.220
It may also be the Starwhale,

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.720
or the sky priestess.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:33.850
I want to go investigate.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:37.520
The Starwhale is flying above us right now.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:41.360
I have come to ask permission to investigate your skies.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.610
Absolutely.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.110
No problem!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.110
No problem at all, but...

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.820
Don't tell us that you're going there alone.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.570
We're totally down for a trip to the sky!

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.870
We'll come help you out!

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.870
I'm glad you said that.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.210
This is a dragon priestess's job,

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.500
but your help will be very much appreciated.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.920
Couvre, Millhi,

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.010
shall we follow her as well?

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:07.760
Yes!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.880
Absolutely!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.640
Is what I'd like to say...

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.520
but I've got quite a load of work that I need to finish.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.770
It looks like all three of us do.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.390
Unfortunately...

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:23.650
You three have your own job down here to do.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.650
We heroes exist for these kinds of jobs!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:26.650
Exactly!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.780
You could probably use our help!

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.950
What an opportunity for research!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.160
My dogs should prove quite useful.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.990
So we have...

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.040
the priestess,

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.450
the three heroes,

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:38.620
Génoise,

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.540
Rico, and Yukikaze.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.790
Don't forget us two!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.790
Can we?

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.420
Gaul, you will represent Galette.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.300
Got it!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:52.430
Lief, use your archery and hearing to help everyone out.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:53.430
Yes!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.300
So, then...

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:56.220
Yes!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:01.440
The <i>entire</i> continent's fate relies on the Starsea.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.190
We'll prepare for the worst down here,

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.820
while the priestess and her allies investigate.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:08.940
Got that, everyone?

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:09.690
Yes!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.960
All right, Starsea Explorers...

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.090
Taking off!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.510
Hang on tight, everyone!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.220
Don't let go of the rope!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:39.100
Yeah!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.770
What's in the box, Rico?

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:47.610
Some secret gadgets that I gathered with the people in Pastillage!

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.240
They'll all prove useful once we start investigating!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.740
Sounds good.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:53.610
Yeah!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.620
It's like I'm on a plane!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.500
Yeah!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.540
It's so humid...

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.880
Clouds are chunks of steam, after all...

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.510
The Flame Dragon doesn't like water.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:15.130
Let's get past the clouds quick!

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:16.140
Hang on tight!

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.260
Everyone doing okay?

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.140
It's tough!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:25.390
It seems like quite an adventure already.

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:28.650
I've gotten used to flying, but...

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.400
We're almost past the clouds!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:53.840
This is the Skysea.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:56.470
I've never seen it before!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:58.590
It's beautiful.

00:08:58.590 --> 00:09:00.010
It's so pretty.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:00.640
Yeah!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.220
Gotta take some pictures!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.390
So glad I brought my camera!

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:05.520
Let me take some!

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.650
So, where's the Starwhale?

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.020
It's up there.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.160
It's huge!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.290
It'll look much bigger up close.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.670
You're right, the Starwhale's coloring is off.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.670
Really?

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.800
It should glitter much more vividly...

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.800
Just like a clear night sky.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.800
Is it sick?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.930
How worrisome...

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.760
The priestess can tell us about it, right?

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.310
Where is she?

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:46.810
Inside the Starwhale.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:49.940
We're going to enter the Starwhale.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.020
I know the way to the priestess.

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.570
Y-You sure?

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.400
We won't end up in its stomach, will we?

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.700
No.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:02.240
We're too small for it to think of us as food.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:06.410
The Skywhale hardly eats anything anyway, right?

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.540
That's right.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.670
Yeah, but still...

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.380
Don't worry.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.960
The Flame Dragon will take us there in no time.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.340
But man, this thing is enormous.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.050
I wonder how many regular-sized whales would fit inside it.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:23.800
What the heck?!

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:24.930
What's that sound?!

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:25.810
I don't know.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.480
Is it...

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:34.190
opening its mouth?

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.070
Should we keep our distance for a bit?

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:38.940
Yeah.

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:40.360
It could be dangerous to-

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.740
Is it sucking us in?!

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:48.000
Seems like it!

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.620
Flame Dragon, escape!

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.340
Rico!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:58.630
Yuki-chan!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.380
Rico!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:02.890
Gotcha!

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:44.130
Where...

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.140
Guys!

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.760
That was horrible!

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.180
Looks like we lost the guys from Galette.

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:54.770
Where are we, anyway?

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.690
We're inside the Starwhale.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.780
This doesn't seem like the insides of an animal.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:04.530
I'm surprised there are lights, although they're a bit dim.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.030
It houses many spirits of light.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.790
They were a lot brighter when I came here before.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:14.040
We should find Gaul and the rest first.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.670
Brave Connect, on!

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.090
Oh! Becky, Shinku!

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.050
You all right?

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:22.760
What about you?

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.920
Is everyone there?

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.140
Yep, here we are.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.180
I made sure your secret chest was okay!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.930
Thank you!

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.140
Is Gaul not there, either?

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.310
Looks like we lost him.

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:35.690
Like I thought.

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.900
He was the last one on the Flame Dragon.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.690
I hope they're at least traveling together.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:44.400
He has his Hero Stone, doesn't he?

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.570
And our stones resonate, so...

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.320
We need to investigate the Starwhale,

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.950
but we should find the prince first.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.240
Yeah!

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:24.900
Oh...

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.900
Right, I landed in a giant lake...

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:31.620
It's so cold...

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.620
I'm surprised I made it out of there while unconscious.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.250
I guess I'm that good... maybe?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.090
Oh, Dryads...

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.630
Oh, they're a different color.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:47.880
They must be similar.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.970
Thanks for helping me out.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.140
I'll get out of here in a bit, so don't be scared of-

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.400
Wh-Who...

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:12.780
Can I use this?

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.790
Thanks a bunch!

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:25.300
It's so warm.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.260
Did you...

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:30.840
Did you help me out of the lake?

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.390
I see.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.010
I'm from Galette.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.180
I'll pay you back sometime.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.720
Thanks.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:41.100
Could I talk to you for a bit?

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.730
Oh, right.

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:48.440
I should dry my clothes.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:53.950
So we're <i>inside</i> the Starwhale right now, right?

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.410
Who are you?

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:57.120
<i>Aria.</i>

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:02.330
Did you just speak directly into my mind?

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.590
Oh, sorry!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:09.970
I just thought your voice was really pretty.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.050
Do you live here?

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:15.640
You don't know, huh?

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.220
What about these guys?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.770
<i>Sylphs.</i>

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:20.850
<i>They're my friends.</i>

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.600
Are there any other humans here?

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.190
Okay.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.690
Do you have amnesia or something?

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:35.820
Maybe you were swallowed a long time ago too.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:41.830
I came here with some other people to check on the Starwhale.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:45.130
We saw something was wrong with the Skysea.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:50.010
So we all came up here to meet the sky priestess,

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:54.220
but it looks like we were split up when the Starwhale swallowed us.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.640
Do you know anything?

00:15:57.140 --> 00:16:00.310
About the Starwhale, or maybe the sky priestess?

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:04.190
Don't worry about it too much.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:07.860
I'm gonna go look for my friends once my clothes are dry.

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:14.280
You wanna come with me?

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.820
Must get boring down here.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.660
The deputy lord of Galette will ensure your safety!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:24.540
<i>But...</i>

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.380
<i>We shouldn't go right now.</i>

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.510
I can't sense Gaul too well...

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:34.300
It looks like we've been separated quite a bit.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.050
How's it going over there, Nanami?

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:38.100
We must be closer than you.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.300
I can feel the resonance.

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.600
Gaul-sama!

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.060
Where are you?!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:46.230
The priestess should know that we're in here.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:48.310
Same goes for the Starwhale.

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.440
It'd usually say something to me, but...

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.440
What?!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.940
The Starwhale can talk?

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.200
More like you can hear its mind.

00:16:57.490 --> 00:17:02.830
The priestess can translate it for us.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.250
It seems complicated,

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:08.460
but the priestess will clear everything up, right?

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.420
We should find Gaul-kun and meet up the priestess.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.630
I hope he's okay.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.470
I just saw something move!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.430
Wait, are those...

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:25.230
Demons!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:26.390
No way...

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.600
Demons in the Starwhale?!

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.650
Mercurius!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.370
I don't understand what's going on...

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.740
But if they're attacking us...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.300
We'll fight our way through!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.250
Let's do it!

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.130
Yeah!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:55.630
Yeah!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:56.630
Yeah.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:02.100
These aren't demons...

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:03.510
And they aren't animals.

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:04.890
Then what are they?!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:06.730
I don't know...

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.770
but I think they're like bacteria and stuff.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:12.060
We'll get nothing done if we get stuck here!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:14.070
Vert and I will clear the way!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:19.490
Let's go!

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.160
You hear that?

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.490
Nanami and the others must be fighting something.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.200
Sorry, Aria.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.660
We'll continue this conversation later.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:28.750
<i>Don't go!</i>

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.500
<i>It's too dangerous.</i>

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:35.000
Thanks for worrying about me.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:38.010
But those are my friends fighting out there.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.630
I have to go and-

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:44.260
Worried about these guys, huh?

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.100
They look like shapeless demons.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.520
<i>They're plague demons.</i>

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.650
<i>They've infected the Starwhale.</i>

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:54.520
<i>They have an evil presence about them.</i>

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.770
I see.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.110
So I can beat them up, right?

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.780
<i>But they're very powerful, and there are many of them here.</i>

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.490
Cool.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:09.660
Then I'd better make sure none of them get me.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.420
Lion King Thunder Claw!

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:29.680
Let's get going, Aria.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:32.600
My friends would be happy to meet you.

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:43.360
How many of these are there?!

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.530
Reminds me of the dragon-eaters.

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:49.080
It was like this, too.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:53.250
Could it be these things that are making the Starwhale sick?

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.620
Maybe.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:56.670
Did you hear that?

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:57.130
Yeah.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:58.750
It's Lord Gaul!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.510
He's coming this way!

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:06.260
Hey, guys!

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.010
Gaul-sama!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:09.640
Lord Gaul, are you all right?!

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.150
Gaul!

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.770
Are you all right, Gaul-kun?!

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.770
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:21.990
I'm glad you're okay, Prince.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.240
We know where we are now.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:28.240
I found a path that I remember taking when I last visited this place.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:31.540
We're currently headed toward the priestess' abode.

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.290
I want you all to go find the Flame Dragon.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:35.580
Got it!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.290
It's alone too, huh?

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.750
We can't let the plague demons get it.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.170
Better find it quick.

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:43.420
Plague demons?

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:46.050
Those weird, demon-looking things.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.800
Aria told me about them.

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:50.010
Aria?

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.680
Char doesn't know either, huh?

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.980
No... I don't know her.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.480
Seems like she's lost, too.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.690
She doesn't even remember how she got here.

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:00.900
I see.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.580
I hear fighting!

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.450
Is the priestess okay?

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:17.870
Priestess!

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:19.460
Farine, the sky priestess!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.920
It's me, Char, the dragon priestess!

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:21.710
Open the door!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.480
Are you all right, priestess?!

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.240
Of course I am.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:53.700
Please forgive the mess, though.

